			"notes": "# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3\n## Changes:\n- Added stonecutter recipes for mini blocks of the new cinnabar, sulfur and poplar blocks (cinnabar, chiseled cinnabar, cinnabar bricks, polished cinnabar, sulfur, chiseled sulfur, polished sulfur, potent sulfur, sulfur bricks, poplar log, poplar planks and orange, red and yellow poplar leaves)\n- The Supercharged advancement says what it really needs: having Haste II (from a beacon or anywhere else)\n\n## Fixes:"
